        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The EVCC uses IPv6 SLAAC for generating addresses for its interface. All interfaces have a link-local address. To ensure unique addresses and to support global addresses, the neighbour discovery protocol (NDP) is used.",
